\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces DSCR class-wise confusion for Llama-4-Scout with its own image (rows: the item's RANO key class; columns: the model's predicted class; recall on the diagonal). Overall accuracy 54.3{}\% is below the majority share (58.7{}\%), but the model is not a constant predictor: it recovers 6{} of 19{} non-majority items while missing some progressive-disease items, so below-majority accuracy is not evidence that the slice is unread.}}{13}{table.caption.42}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:confusion}{{5}{13}{DSCR class-wise confusion for Llama-4-Scout with its own image (rows: the item's RANO key class; columns: the model's predicted class; recall on the diagonal). Overall accuracy \vfourConfScoutAcc {}\% is below the majority share (\vfourConfScoutMajority {}\%), but the model is not a constant predictor: it recovers \vfourConfOffMajority {} of \vfourConfOffMajorityN {} non-majority items while missing some progressive-disease items, so below-majority accuracy is not evidence that the slice is unread}{table.caption.42}{}}
